{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What starts as a routine investigation soon turns into a descent into darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They call him <strong>Manivore</strong>. More than just a killer\u2026 He is cold-blooded, intelligent, and manipulative. He doesn\u2019t just kill his victims; he erases their traces, dismembers them, and leaves behind nothing but a grotesque work of art. For him, death is not an escape but the final piece of a meticulously crafted puzzle. And now, you are part of that puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PHOTOGRAPH THE EVIDENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your camera to identify clues and evidence at the crime scene. Some truths cannot be seen with the naked eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601980/extras/FOTO.gif?t=1742991143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your mind and the clues around you to unravel the mysteries and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601980/extras/PUZZLE.gif?t=1742991143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STAY ALERT TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to every sound, someone might be watching you. Watch your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601980/extras/KUKLA.gif?t=1742991143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photo Capture Mechanic</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Realistic Graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High-Quality Sound Design</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety of Puzzles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>If you don\u2019t want to end up on his table, play by his rules.</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601980?t=1742991143","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601980/a3c6335b1b1dc17e934e609ce1f91f6facc5d7e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742991143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601980/6bf7ce1bbee6c5bd35e4c4de49b182fe95b1846f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742991143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601980/6bf7ce1bbee6c5bd35e4c4de49b182fe95b1846f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742991143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Manivore is a psychological horror game with mature themes. The game includes depictions of violence, torture, death, bodily harm, and cannibalism. Players will encounter blood, corpses, and disturbing scenes. Additionally, the game features psychological tension, a frightening atmosphere, and unsettling dialogues. Players sensitive to such content should proceed with caution."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What starts as a routine investigation soon turns into a descent into darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They call him <strong>Manivore</strong>. More than just a killer\u2026 He is cold-blooded, intelligent, and manipulative. He doesn\u2019t just kill his victi